From daecf099618d4cc6da7f037a3559f23ca4f7e813 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:21:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Show copy to clipboard buttons for the URI and DOI on
 item pages

Add an optional "copyable" input to ds-item-page-uri-field and
ds-metadata-uri-values that renders a ds-copy-to-clipboard button next
to each value. The separator is now rendered after the link (and copy
button) instead of inside the link.

The simple Publication and untyped item pages enable it for
dc.identifier.uri (the item's handle) and now also display
dc.identifier.doi, which DSpace stores as a resolvable https://doi.org/
URL, with a copy button.
